<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>More gratitude give me,</l><l>More trust in the Lord,</l><l>More zeal for His glory,</l><l>More hope in His Word,</l><l>More tears for His sorrows,</l><l>More pain at His grief,</l><l>More meekness in trial,</l><l>More praise for relief.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>More victory give me,</l><l>More strength to o’ercome,</l><l>More freedom from earth-stains,</l><l>More quest for the throne,</l><l>More fit for the kingdom,</l><l>More useful I’d be,</l><l>More blessed and holy,</l><l>More, Savior, like Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
